## Note on the data

The datasets in this repository are **entirely synthetic**, generated by
`src/ebt_generator.py`. They contain no real cardholder, beneficiary, or
transaction data, and no personal information of any kind. There is therefore
no privacy or program-rule restriction on redistributing them.

They should not be described as representing observed EBT fraud. Every fraud
pattern in them was specified and injected by the author according to the
sourcing recorded in `SPEC.md` §3.2, and the fraud prevalence in the primary
dataset is deliberately elevated. See the LIMITATIONS section of `README.md`
before using these data to support any claim.
